		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Eric Lengyel: Created page with &amp;quot;The following table lists the locations where certain types of files created by the C4 Engine are stored under Windows.  {| {{Table}} {{Tablehead|File Type|File Location}} |- {{Tablerow|Log file|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\''&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;''\AppData\Local\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}} |- {{Tablerow|Configuration files|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;\AppData\Roaming\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}} |- {{Tablerow|Screenshots and saved games|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;\Documents\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}}...&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The following table lists the locations where certain types of files created by the C4 Engine are stored under Windows.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
{| {{Table}}&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablehead|File Type|File Location}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|Log file|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\''&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;''\AppData\Local\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|Configuration files|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;\AppData\Roaming\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|[[Screenshots]] and saved games|&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C:\Users\&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;\Documents\C4 Engine\&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;}}&lt;br /&gt;
|}&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Here, &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;''&amp;amp;lt;username&amp;amp;gt;''&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; should be replaced with the login name of the current user.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;AppData&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; directory is not visible unless you show hidden files and folders (in '''Folders Options''' under the '''View''' tab).&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
== Log File ==&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Every time the C4 Engine runs, it creates a log file in HTML format named &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;C4-Log.html&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;. The file is placed in the directory designated by the operating system for per-user local application support files.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
== Configuration Files ==&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
When the user changes the game settings, the configuration files &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;engine.cfg&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;input.cfg&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; are saved to the directory designated by the operating system for per-user roaming application support files.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
== Screenshots and Saved Games ==&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
[[Screenshots]] and saved games are stored in the user's documents directory.&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<author><name>Eric Lengyel</name></author>
	</entry>
	<entry>
